💡 **SUGGESTION: unused `context` parameter in `_summaryExtraRows`**

The new `_summaryExtraRows` helper takes `BuildContext context` (passed from `_summaryPage`) but never uses it — both switch arms forward only `record`/`snapshot`/`strings`/`errorColor`:

```dart
List<Widget> _summaryExtraRows(
  BuildContext context,   // ← unused
  TrajectoryRecord record,
  ...
) => switch (record) {
  TrajectoryAssistantRecord() => _assistantSummaryRows(record, snapshot, strings, errorColor),
  ...
};
```

Drop the parameter (and the corresponding argument in `_summaryPage`) to keep the helper's contract honest. This also removes a needless `Theme.of(context)` evaluation at the call site.

